    "detailed_description": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u592a\u967d\u306e\u5869 - A Sun Of Salt</h2></strong><br>Unravel the mystery, the horror, and the people aboard your ship as captain of a small crew on a lifelong mission into the unknown.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Visual novel gameplay.<br></li><li>Get to know an evolving cast of characters.<br></li><li>Take part in a dramatic sci-fi tale that can turn from romance to horror in an instant.<br></li><li>Unravel the true nature of your mission.<br></li><li>Experience love, death, or friendship in branching paths that lead to one of 4 endings.<br></li><li>Get a small glimpse into the mind of your crew with experimental technology.</li></ul>",
